Domain Entity LocalContractedStaff
    documentation "The set of local education agency or charter management organization contracted staff amounts."
    domain entity Staff
        documentation "References the staff with which the local contracted staff is associated."
        is part of identity
    domain entity LocalAccount
        documentation "References the local account with which the local contracted staff is associated."
        is part of identity
    date AsOfDate
        documentation "The date of the reported amount for the account."
        is part of identity
        is queryable field
    currency Amount
        documentation "Current balance for the account."
        is required
    descriptor FinancialCollection
        documentation "The accounting period or grouping for which the amount is collected."
        is optional
